{"id":"5b4ea905da483052","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md","title":"Kurepa Hypothesis","display":"df-kurepa-hypothesis — Kurepa Hypothesis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kurepa-hypothesis","aliases":["58-df-kurepa-hypothesis"],"display":"df-kurepa-hypothesis — Kurepa Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[58-df-kurepa-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kurepa-hypothesis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kurepa-hypothesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurepa-hypothesis — Kurepa Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8519e320aac8e03\" href=\"?note=a8519e320aac8e03\" title=\"58-df-kurepa-tree\">58-df-kurepa-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,T,&lt;_{T}\">\\(\\kappa,T,&lt;_{T}\\)</span> (ZFC object variables for the cardinal and tree parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KH}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KH}_S\\)</span> (Kurepa hypothesis predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\\)</span> (Kurepa-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8519e320aac8e03\" href=\"?note=a8519e320aac8e03\" title=\"58-df-kurepa-tree\">58-df-kurepa-tree</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\exists T\\;\\exists &lt;_{T}\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\exists T\\;\\exists &lt;_{T}\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> states the existence of a Kurepa <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree; level-size and branch conditions belong to the upstream Kurepa-tree predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KH}\">\\(\\mathrm{KH}\\)</span> follows from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span> but not from GCH.</li>\n<li>Classical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KH}\">\\(\\mathrm{KH}\\)</span> implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_1}\\geq\\aleph_2\">\\(2^{\\aleph_1}\\geq\\aleph_2\\)</span> through its family of cofinal branches; it does not force the continuum to be at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_2\">\\(\\aleph_2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-kurepa-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-kurepa-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-kurepa-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S$ (Kurepa-tree predicate, see [[58-df-kurepa-tree]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,T,<_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KH}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\exists T\\;\\exists <_{T}\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KH}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_1}\\geq\\aleph_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_2","display":false}],"bytes":1089,"backlinks":[{"id":"a80188e1b4b9bc28","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-748","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md|58-df-kurepa-hypothesis]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a8519e320aac8e03"]}